From: TicWatch Pro 5 port
Subject: [PATCH] soc: qcom: make slatecom SSR registration optional

Avoid a built-in link dependency on modular QCOM_RPROC_COMMON.
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [configuration-specific]
---
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/slatecom_interface.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/slatecom_interface.c
@@ -1277,6 +1277,10 @@
 {
 	int i;
 
+	/* qcom_register_ssr_notifier only exists when its provider is built-in. */
+	if (!IS_BUILTIN(CONFIG_QCOM_RPROC_COMMON))
+		return;
+
 	for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_SIZE(service_data); i++) {
 		if ((service_data[i].domain_id < 0) ||
 				(service_data[i].domain_id >= SSR_DOMAIN_MAX)) {
